# Legacy index.html URL -> canonical root
/index.html  /  301

# The two furniture hubs collided when categories became landing pages.
# /products/majlis-sofa is now the furniture category page and absorbed the
# "Sofas" copy as its own section. This 301 only fires because
# out/products/sofa.html is no longer emitted -- Pages serves a matching static
# asset before it consults this file.
/products/sofa  /products/majlis-sofa  301

# NOTE: the SPA fallback rule (/*  /index.html  200) was deliberately removed.
# Every route is now a real prerendered HTML file, and that rule made every
# unknown URL return HTTP 200 with the 404 page -- a soft-404 to crawlers.
# Without it, Cloudflare Pages serves out/404.html with a real 404 status.
